If you're coming in at Union Station, you should make your way to the metro
station (not far from the train station). Union Station is on the red line.
Get on it going toward Shady Grove, then transfer at Metro Center onto the
orange line going toward Vienna. Where exactly you'll get off depends on
where is convenient for whomever is picking you up, but most likely you'll
get off at either Vienna or West Falls Church.

